{"id": "sfusd-school-bus-closure-invoices", "title": "SFUSD’s bus operator sought $5.4 million and agreed to pay the district $1 million", "seconds": 52.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.051, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "39bbb7e4ebe7ade4", "words": 124, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "First Student sought $5.4 million from San Francisco’s school district.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.38, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5.4 million", "label": "Disputed invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.77, 1.12, 1.52, 1.85, 2.18, 2.55, 3.34, 3.57, 3.79, 4.41, 4.72]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The company kept buses ready while students learned remotely.", "t0": 5.5, "t1": 8.84, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The company kept buses ready while students learned remotely"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.5, 0.73, 1.15, 1.71, 1.99, 2.43, 2.77]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The operator cited insurance and maintenance costs.", "t0": 8.96, "t1": 11.63, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "trial", "kicker": "School closures", "text": "Insurance and maintenance", "mark": "Insurance and maintenance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.66, 1.05, 1.57, 1.69, 2.13]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "District counsel cited the closure provision. SFUSD declined the invoices and countersued.", "t0": 11.75, "t1": 18.61, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "District counsel cited the closure provision. SFUSD declined the invoices and countersued"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.95, 1.32, 1.43, 1.86, 3.14, 4.31, 4.83, 4.96, 5.92, 6.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "KQED reported a jury finding under the California False Claims Act.", "t0": 18.83, "t1": 23.98, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "outcome", "kicker": "March 2023", "text": "California False Claims Act", "mark": "California False Claims Act"}, "wt": [0.0, 1.22, 1.71, 1.81, 2.23, 2.76, 3.03, 3.15, 3.88, 4.32, 4.83]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The jury also found no harm from the unpaid invoices.", "t0": 24.1, "t1": 27.26, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The jury also found no harm from the unpaid invoices"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.47, 0.81, 1.09, 1.37, 1.76, 1.93, 2.05, 2.46]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The answers kept the trial open. The parties settled the next day.", "t0": 27.38, "t1": 31.39, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "outcome", "kicker": "Settlement announced", "text": "March 24, 2023", "mark": "March 24, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.68, 0.92, 1.03, 1.44, 2.26, 2.46, 2.88, 3.29, 3.4, 3.67]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "First Student said neither side admitted liability.", "t0": 31.51, "t1": 34.35, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "First Student said neither side admitted liability"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.73, 1.02, 1.39, 1.72, 2.12]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "On March 27, six board members voted for the settlement.", "t0": 34.57, "t1": 38.44, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Board of Education", "text": "March 27, 2023", "mark": "March 27, 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.5, 1.57, 2.01, 2.36, 2.77, 3.11, 3.23, 3.34]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "One board member was absent.", "t0": 38.56, "t1": 39.94, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "One board member was absent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.48, 0.74, 0.93]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "First Student agreed to pay SFUSD $1 million.", "t0": 40.06, "t1": 43.76, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1 million", "label": "First Student to SFUSD"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.71, 1.05, 1.15, 1.48, 2.68, 2.92, 3.23]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The minutes establish the obligation. District receipts would confirm collection.", "t0": 43.88, "t1": 48.47, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Payment date", "Receipt"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.5, 1.03, 1.15, 2.39, 2.83, 3.34, 3.54, 3.99]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.59, "t1": 51.09, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.88, 1.05, 1.34, 1.42, 1.52, 1.77, 2.06]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The unpaid invoices", "b": "The jury’s answers", "o": "The board vote"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}